WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:58.760
THE SADIDA TEMPLE

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:38.000
Here we are, at last,
after all these years.

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:47.760
My friends, we're nearing our goal!

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:51.120
-You don't have any doubts?
-No, but do you?

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:54.920
We're going for the gods.
Only a madman wouldn't.

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:57.600
Will they surrender?

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:02.320
You have the Eliatrope Dofus
and I have the Eliacube Adamai.

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:05.400
They're not powerful with these weapons.

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:09.520
The most powerful, Goultard,
was defeated easily.

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:12.280
He wasn't the real Iop god!

00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:17.720
You can doubt many things,
but never doubt our cause.

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:21.520
It's time to give this universe
gods it deserves.

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:25.920
A gambler, an underwear collector,
a psychopath, and children.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.400
Some of your demigods
won't do much better.

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:32.560
-We'll watch them carefully.
-Yeah right!

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:41.760
We know what you're capable of.
Nobody would dream of defying you.

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:46.400
Tell me, my handsome dragon,
I suppose I'm the psychopath.

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:48.280
Know any others?

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:51.360
No!

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:53.560
Why are you here, Toxine?

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:58.520
Evangelyne and her kid have escaped.
They must be on the Cra level.

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:01.440
How did they escape my temple?

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:07.240
If you spent more time there instead
of flirting with Oropo, you'd know.

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:09.760
You!

00:03:11.720 --> 00:03:16.920
Stop acting like children.
Go find them and bring them to me.

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:23.400
You get so worked up these days,
you seem troubled.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.160
Do me a favor and shut up.

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:44.320
Is this necessary? You've changed
since the brotherhood arrived.

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:50.840
You're right. Their presence reminds me
of my non-existence, of who I'm not.

00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:54.640
But you can still have faith in me,
I won't fail.

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:10.800
Wow! Looks like a training room.

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:17.880
This is the Cra level. Be cautious.

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:24.680
Mama, it looks like your bow.

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:28.040
It was destroyed when Adamai attacked.

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:32.960
You're right. That is my bow.

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:43.120
It's okay, darling,
just the baby sending signals.

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:46.760
We need to get out and find your father.

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:51.040
I promise I won't let anyone hurt you,
or the baby.

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:55.240
I know you won't. Help me.
Let's find a way out.

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:10.800
That way. Don't waste time.

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:14.480
Okay, shouldn't we take weapons,
just in case?

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:17.120
Quickly. I have a bad feeling.

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:35.440
Oh?

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:40.960
The rats are leaving the ship.

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:16.760
Is... this a dream?

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:21.920
I'm having the same one.
We're in a tower. How are we in a field?

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:25.400
We must be on Sadida level. Feel anything?

00:06:31.520 --> 00:06:34.080
Was talking about you and Amalia.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:38.840
I'm not sure if what I feel is love.
I'm not ready for it.

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:43.400
-I feel like I'll live forever.
-Have you talked to Amalia?

00:06:43.480 --> 00:06:48.440
Yes and no. I tried but I can't get
a word in with that princess.

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:51.160
Sometimes she's so self-absorbed.

00:06:56.760 --> 00:07:01.080
I feel a lot of sadness, Yugo,
but it's not from here.

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:04.560
Right.

00:07:11.880 --> 00:07:15.840
I can't seem to communicate
with the plants.

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:19.120
No, I don't feel a single thing.

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:39.320
Maybe not a good idea.

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:44.240
Greetings, Brotherhood of Tofu.

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:48.280
Oropo, master of this tower,
told me of your coming.

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:51.000
I've been looking forward to this.

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:56.600
Follow, my dolls.
They will lead you to me.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:04.400
It's not like
we had anything better to do.

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:08.080
Grandpa Ruel is less scared than usual.

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:13.560
The first time being called Grandpa
didn't bother you!

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:16.600
People get used to things, Elely.

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:22.360
Be on guard.
This place isn't what it seems.

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:24.800
There's no life in the plants.

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:27.480
Amalia, you seem upset.

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:36.120
Women are complicated, aren't they?

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:39.840
Complicated and troubling.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:50.080
-Aren't you overdoing it, Amalia?
-Such a fake friend!

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:53.960
I heard what you said to Yugo on Enutrof.

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:57.840
You think I'm self-absorbed
and can't see when others are in pain.

00:08:57.920 --> 00:08:59.400
That's what Yugo said.

00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:01.760
And you don't think the same?

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:05.280
-About you? I think much worse.
-What?

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:10.800
Look at yourself. You're always acting
like an obnoxious princess.

00:09:11.560 --> 00:09:14.440
You treat your friends like servants.

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:18.640
After everything we've been through,
how dare you?

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:22.800
Yugo is like my son.
I don't know what he sees in you.

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:29.560
You're making him suffer when he needs
to concentrate on more important things.

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:46.840
Please, I'll do whatever you want,
but let me go.

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:51.280
You're my husband, Ruel,
for better or worse.

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:54.560
Though there were more worse with you.

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:57.360
I gave you everything, Ruel.

00:09:57.440 --> 00:10:01.440
Everything I had and you? You ran away!

00:10:01.520 --> 00:10:05.240
I'm sorry for it all,
I know I made a mistake.

00:10:06.760 --> 00:10:09.560
A mistake? That's one way to put it.

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:14.640
There I was imagining a family,
a bunch of little Enutrofs.

00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:16.520
They cost a lot, though.

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.560
You're not funny!

00:10:18.640 --> 00:10:22.240
Thanks to Oropo,
we'll make up for lost time.

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:24.040
He's making you a god.

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:27.920
This is ridiculous!
Don't tell me you believe it!

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:29.960
Of course I do, you fool!

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:33.320
Would I go to all this trouble, if not?

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:36.800
After your betrayal, I was broken.

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:41.480
I wasted years of my life crying,
until Oropo made me a deal.

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:43.640
To make me into a god.

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:46.280
We'll finally be together, Ruel.

00:10:46.360 --> 00:10:48.960
We'll be rich. We'll have it all.

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.160
Arpagone...

00:10:50.680 --> 00:10:55.040
Don't push me away again, Ruel.
I love you.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:11:01.360
With your beautiful bare scalp
and wrinkles and three remaining teeth.

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:03.360
No, but...

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:08.760
I'm crazy about you, Ruel.
Don't push me away.

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:33.680
-Did you think the door was just for dogs?
-Tell us how to get to the next level!

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:41.000
Of course. It'll cost your undies.

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:55.280
That's two more pairs.

00:11:56.600 --> 00:12:01.520
-Quicker to have smashed his teeth in.
-You should be proud of me.

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:07.000
I was trying to think like Yugo.
He'd have preferred this to a fight.

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:09.920
If you say so...

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:16.280
Oh! Aren't they just adorable
with their little bows?

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:19.400
Silence, Toxine, don't poison things.

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:21.640
Poisoning is what I do best.

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:25.800
I told you, we mean you no harm.

00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:28.000
Oropo has big plans for your kids.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:30.000
And I told you no!

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:34.200
Our mission is more important, Evangelyne.

00:12:34.280 --> 00:12:39.560
Look around. It was designed for Flopin.
He'll be a perfect Cra god.

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:43.160
Do you understand
what we're offering them?

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:45.560
You can't decide their future.

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:48.800
Unfortunately, it is for the greater good.

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:55.400
They're children of a god and ideal
to replace the imbeciles that rule us.

00:12:55.480 --> 00:12:59.160
We want you to join us.
I promise you won't...

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:12.640
You... You...

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:16.040
You should have let me handle this.

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:20.360
We don't always agree
on how the brotherhood should act.

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:22.360
Toxine, what are you...

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:27.040
-Save your strength. You'll need it.
-Stay behind me, Flopin.

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:30.800
I've disliked your arrogance
for quite a while.

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:36.160
Pining over the handsome Oropo,
while others do the dirty work.

00:13:38.760 --> 00:13:42.000
Unlike everyone else, I know who I am.

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:46.960
I despise stuck-up people,
who think they're better than others.

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:51.040
And you, blondie,
that definitely includes you.

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:55.760
So, I can't resist the urge
to teach you a lesson.

00:13:56.520 --> 00:13:58.520
You are completely insane.

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:00.560
Oropo will never forgive you.

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:05.320
Yes, he will. He chose me
as the future Sram goddess.

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:08.760
He must have known
I'd stab him in the back.

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:11.320
Anyway, who says he'll find out?

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:13.040
Behind me, Mama!

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:17.000
Finally, someone who understands me.

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:32.560
Look at yourself.

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:36.480
Nearly there.

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:06.360
I am Dathura and you're in my domain.

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:09.360
One of the dolls of the Sadida god.

00:15:09.920 --> 00:15:14.840
I haven't been out in a long time.
It surprises me that you know me.

00:15:15.400 --> 00:15:19.640
Interesting, but we're not here
for a plant history lesson.

00:15:19.720 --> 00:15:23.320
I guess there's a test
before we can move up.

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:28.000
Sorry to disappoint, Elely,
but I don't engage in those games.

00:15:28.680 --> 00:15:31.560
I simply wish to talk to you a while.

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:35.800
First, I want to know
how my little Ogrest is.

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:38.680
I heard you took the Dofus from him.

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:43.000
He's okay, with his father, Otomai.
Do you know him?

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:47.040
I am responsible for what happened to him.

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:50.440
I've always regretted my actions.

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:52.120
It's true?

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:54.920
Ogrest nearly destroyed
the World of Twelve,

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:56.800
as he thought you were dead.

00:15:56.880 --> 00:15:59.920
Every evolution requires sacrifice.

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:02.280
However, I feel so guilty.

00:16:02.360 --> 00:16:05.600
So, I will tell you
what Oropo plans to do.

00:16:05.680 --> 00:16:08.680
Maybe you'll understand why I'm helping.

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:12.480
We don't have the time
and what if she's lying?

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:15.600
You? How dare you?

00:16:19.800 --> 00:16:20.920
Ruel!

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:28.480
Nothing but a baby.
Do you think you can take me?

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:32.480
No, but my mother has already
defeated you before.

00:16:32.560 --> 00:16:34.920
She can do it again.

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:40.480
I underestimated you two before.
That won't happen again.

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:45.520
-I missed her.
-It happens.

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:48.280
Not to sound conceited, but... not to me.

00:17:05.160 --> 00:17:06.280
Flopin, no!

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:18.400
Leave him alone, you psychopath!

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:28.120
I don't really know why I hate you.

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:31.480
Don't take it personally. I hate everyone.

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:32.800
I can't help it.

00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:43.000
Impossible! That never happens to me.

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:46.880
She's trapped us.
We're not in the Cra temple now.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:48.440
Oh, bad girl!

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:53.480
If you explain all my tricks,
we can't stay friends.

00:17:53.560 --> 00:17:55.960
It's all fake, even the arrows.

00:18:11.160 --> 00:18:13.320
Of course, how stupid of me.

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:20.760
They're useless. Toxine tricked us.

00:18:20.840 --> 00:18:24.880
I know, but I have an idea.
We can still find a use.

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:30.040
-What are you doing?
-The traps are real.

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:33.360
I can make a real weapon
if I combine them.

00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:46.240
My dear, I wanted to wait,
but you're ruining my fun.

00:18:56.440 --> 00:19:00.440
-Have you heard of my well of shadows?
-No, not that...!

00:19:14.160 --> 00:19:17.320
Oh, that's right. I've already told you.

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:22.040
Nobody ever returns.
Honestly, I don't know what's there.

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:24.480
A representation of my soul--

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:27.840
Stop, Toxine! You can't do this to me!

00:19:27.920 --> 00:19:32.000
I know it's very cruel...
but I just can't help it.

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:34.920
Flopin, whatever you're doing,
do it quickly!

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:36.520
Almost done... Almost!

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:40.560
I know how this works, Echo.

00:19:40.640 --> 00:19:44.920
In this dimension Oropo has created,
we can do anything.

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:48.240
Our stages are a reflection
of what we are.

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:53.880
But if we can't play with them,
what good are they?

00:19:57.120 --> 00:20:00.040
Remember what I taught you, sweetie.

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:02.920
Oh, my, still so full of hope.

00:20:09.880 --> 00:20:12.360
Mama... the smoke... It's...

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:15.080
Does it make you cry? Poor thing.

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:26.160
Impressive!

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:29.600
You're doing well,
but you've already lost.

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:31.680
You're in my home, after all!

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:41.440
Flopin!

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:23.440
That was fun, but playtime is over now!

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:30.000
Flopin, get down!

00:21:39.600 --> 00:21:42.280
Little vermin! You'll pay for that!

00:21:43.720 --> 00:21:44.560
You!

00:22:15.560 --> 00:22:16.760
Perper...

00:22:17.760 --> 00:22:21.360
I felt it, too. It's... It's Eva.

00:22:22.760 --> 00:22:24.560
Something's happened to her.

